          the number of hours, remaining minutes, and seconds. Fill in the formulas for 1, 2, and 3 below.</p>
      </statement>
      <program language="python" interactive="activecode">
        <code>
        # 1. Ask the user for the number of minutes they have spent in class
        minutesStr = input("How many minutes have you spent in class? ")
        # convert the input to an int
        minutes = int(minutesStr)

        # 1. calculate the hours in minutes by using integer division // (there are 60 minutes in an hour)
        hours = 
        # 2. calculate the remaining minutes in minutes using the mod % operator and 60
        remainingMinutes = 
        # 3. calculate the number of seconds in minutes with multiplication (there are 60 seconds in a minute)
        seconds = 
        
        # print the results
